{"3931490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Tonbrook", "steam_appid": 3931490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/497cee15db030735d54589fed9600f05.avif?t=1787871204\" alt=\"Welcome to Tonbrook!\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tonbrook is a cozy life sim mixed with the adventure and wonder of a Dungeons and Dragons game.  You play a character of your own making who receives an invitation to attend the Daverton Adventurer's Academy, well-known for producing some of the greatest sellswords in all of the Erreban Penninsula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.poster.avif?t=1787871204\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.webm?t=1787871204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.mp4?t=1787871204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pay for schooling by going on missions that various clients hire the Academy for, and the rest of time you can spend studying, exploring, and forming relationships with the other students.  You can also enrich your wallet by looting, farming, fishing,  waiting tables, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/0993960251b82b60c934041ba0924ed4.avif?t=1787871204\" alt=\"Featuring:\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large open world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of characters with relationship mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different skills to level up with study or practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of ways to make money: fishing, farming, running a factory, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story with rich lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, party-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/497cee15db030735d54589fed9600f05.avif?t=1787871204\" alt=\"Welcome to Tonbrook!\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Tonbrook is a cozy life sim mixed with the adventure and wonder of a Dungeons and Dragons game.  You play a character of your own making who receives an invitation to attend the Daverton Adventurer's Academy, well-known for producing some of the greatest sellswords in all of the Erreban Penninsula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.poster.avif?t=1787871204\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.webm?t=1787871204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/d89c005dc5a66125349abd3134669c80.mp4?t=1787871204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pay for schooling by going on missions that various clients hire the Academy for, and the rest of time you can spend studying, exploring, and forming relationships with the other students.  You can also enrich your wallet by looting, farming, fishing,  waiting tables, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/extras/0993960251b82b60c934041ba0924ed4.avif?t=1787871204\" alt=\"Featuring:\" width=800 height=195 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large open world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of characters with relationship mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different skills to level up with study or practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of ways to make money: fishing, farming, running a factory, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story with rich lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, party-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creation and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Tales of Tonbrook is a life-sim/RPG hybrid. When you receive an invitation to the prestigious Daverton Adventurer's Academy, you take it! Study, perform missions for the school to pay your way, explore the world, make friends, fish, farm, find hidden ruins, and much more!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/909f81ed3d59e9fa294e1e6cf045e2ca52aa317b/header.jpg?t=1787871204", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931490/fb41adb0a03a543a17c025af25489f04c40732